Usage: wq e/moonshot.wq -- [OPTIONS]

Moonshot Delivery - a pocket-sized lunar lander

Controls:
  w  main engine       a  thrust left       d  thrust right
  wa main + left       wd main + right      .  coast
  q  abandon mission

Land on the === pad with vertical speed at most 3.5 and horizontal
speed at most 2.0. Every burn costs fuel, so elegance earns points.

Options:
  --demo  let the onboard computer fly the lander
  --plain  use compact, color-free output
  --seed <N>  replay a mission with a positive seed
  --max-turns <N>  abort after N turns (default: 160)
  -h, --help  Print help
